WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
For my birthday.

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.920
We came to Yale
and the first snow of the year happened

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:07.007
and my tour was walking through Old Campus

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:10.218
and people were just building snowmen
and having a snowball fight.

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:12.846
I felt this feeling of home at Yale.

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:15.181
I knew that I had to go here.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.475
It was my dream from that day on.

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:20.770
Originally, the plan had not been
to go to college right after high school.

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:23.440
I was very apprehensive
about even applying to Yale

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:26.443
because I thought I wouldn't fit in here
and I wouldn't be happy here.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:29.320
It shattered my expectations
of what I thought Yale was.

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:32.615
I remember
watching The Why I Toured Yale video,

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:35.410
just like in my living room
and just thinking, this looks fun.

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:38.788
You've got the a cappellas, you got
the dancing groups, the cultural

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:42.208
affinity groups, and it just looks like
a really fun space to be in.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.502
And I just really desired
to be a part of that.

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:47.797
My mom is my best friend
and so it was very hard to leave her.

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:50.383
She knew that
it was the best decision for me

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.177
and she wanted me to like,
reach my dreams.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:54.054
And she knew
it was an incredible opportunity.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.638
I knew that if I was going to be able

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:57.640
to achieve these big goals
that I had in mind,

00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:00.810
it was going to be a tough decision
and it was going to take a big change.

